conx-ps:OnTime a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-project/project-status> ; skos:prefLabel "On Time"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Im Zeitplan"@de .
conx-ps:Delayed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-project/project-status> ; skos:prefLabel "Delayed"@en ; skos:prefLabel "In Verzug"@de .
conx-ps:Blocked a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-project/project-status> ; skos:prefLabel "Blocked"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Blockiert"@de .
conx-ps:Completed a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme <https://www.construct-x.org/vocab/construction-project/project-status> ; skos:prefLabel "Completed"@en ; skos:prefLabel "Abgeschlossen"@de .
